Transcript fixtures
The files under daemon/fardeskd/test/fixtures/transcripts are structure captured from Claude Code session
files with all free text replaced by filler (see the INDEX.md next to them). The file layout is Claude Code's
own, undocumented format; it belongs to Anthropic and can change in any release. The fixtures name tools of
some third-party connectors (tool names starting with mcp__); those names are used only to test the parser.

